====================================================
KEY TAKEAWAYS
====================================================

Day 22 focused on understanding how Artificial Intelligence can be used responsibly and effectively.

Major Learnings:

- AI is a powerful productivity tool when used correctly.
- Prompt quality significantly impacts output quality.
- Critical thinking remains essential even when using AI.
- Responsible AI usage is as important as technical knowledge.
- AI should enhance human capabilities, not replace learning.

Today was focused on building AI awareness and developing a stronger foundation for future learning in AI and software engineering.